  "raw_text": "PLAN \"Week 5 Deload\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary recovery:\n    name \"Reduce accumulated fatigue before next training block\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Deload Week\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Upper Push Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          incline_press 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          shoulder_press 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          lateral_raise 2x10 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_pushdown 2x10 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 2m\n\n      DAY Tuesday training 40m \"Lower Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          romanian_deadlift 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          leg_press 2x10 rpe 4 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          calf_raise 2x12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 2m\n\n      DAY Wednesday training 30m \"Active Recovery\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          dead_bug 2x10 rpe 3 rest 60 seconds\n          bird_dog 2x10 rpe 3 rest 60 seconds\n          plank 2x20..30 rpe 3 rest 60 seconds\n          cat_cow 2x10 rpe 2 rest 45 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12 rpe 3 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 2m\n\n      DAY Thursday training 45m \"Upper Pull Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 8m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bent_over_row 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          seated_row 2x10 rpe 4 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          bicep_curl 2x10 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_stretch 2m\n\n      DAY Friday training 45m \"Full Body Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 2x5 rpe 5 rest 150 seconds\n          dumbbell_press 2x8 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          goblet_squat 2x10 rpe 4 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 2x10 rpe 4 rest 90 seconds\n          hip_thrust 2x10 rpe 4 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          forward_fold 2m\n\n      DAY Saturday training 30m \"Mobility and Flush\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          hip_circles 2x10 rpe 2 rest 30 seconds\n          leg_swings 2x10 rpe 2 rest 30 seconds\n          scapular_retraction 2x12 rpe 2 rest 30 seconds\n          external_rotation 2x12 rpe 2 rest 30 seconds\n          cat_cow 2x10 rpe 2 rest 30 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          spinal_twist 2m\n\n      DAY Sunday rest \"Full Rest Day\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 20m\n        main straight_sets:\n          diaphragmatic_breathing 3x5 rpe 1 rest 30 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 5m",
